title: "AV Scenario Runner"
abstract: >-
  A declarative TOML scenario format and deterministic regression harness for
  autonomous driving controllers, scoring each run against assertions that
  report the worst value observed, the second it happened, and the bound it was
  tested against rather than a bare verdict.
